petition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_IronChef_us","title":"Iron Chef","released":"2026-11-28T16:19:37Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:19:37Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:11:14Z","overview":"The former Iron Chef Michiba decides that Morimoto needs some help finding his feet, so he recruits his number one sous-chef from his own days at Kitchen Stadium.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_IronChef_us","title":"Iron Chef","released":"2026-11-28T17:11:14Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:11:14Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:02:41Z","overview":"Japan's culinary media is dominated by today's challenger, a food critic, musician and graphic artist. Kentaro is determined to make a name for himself at Kitchen Stadium.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_IronChef_us","title":"Iron Chef","released":"2026-11-28T18:02:41Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:02:41Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:54:11Z","overview":"The Iron Chef Italian is challenged by a chef hailing from Kyoto who never ceases to pack his restaurant with customers.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_IronChef_us","title":"Iron Chef","released":"2026-11-28T18:54:11Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:54:11Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:45:41Z","overview":"Morimoto fights a traditionalist chef who fills his dishes with nostalgia.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_IronChef_us","title":"Iron Chef","released":"2026-11-28T19:45:41Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:45:41Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:37:10Z","overview":"Meiji Kinenkan is the oldest bridal hall in Japan undergoing an upgrade to celebrate its 50th anniversary. This includes the addition of a Chinese restaurant and its new grand chef.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_IronChef_us","title":"Iron Chef","released":"2026-11-28T20:37:10Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:37:10Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:28:40Z","overview":"Iron Chef Chen stirs up his best yogurt presentat